data: {"id": "41ea32f5e02c44d9-thinking-parallel_evidence-2645", "run_id": "41ea32f5e02c44d9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 已确认事实\n1. **Pod 身份与状态**：`aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 的 `phase` 仍为 **Pending**，`nodeName: None`，`PodScheduled` 条件为 **False**。\n2. **Pending 根因**：Pod 设置了 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`，而集群中 **3 个节点（master、node1、node2）均没有此标签**。\n3. **调度事件**：`FailedScheduling` 持续 65 分钟，重复 8 次，原文为 `\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"`。\n4. **节点状态**：全部 3 个节点均为 **Ready**，资源充足（QoS 请求仅 5m CPU / 8Mi memory），不存在资源不足问题。\n\n### 候选原因判定\n-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788407747015, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

